<title>UK: Merrill Lynch sets warrants on ABB AG.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets warrants on ABB AG.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch Capital Markets AG said it has issued three million American-style call and put warrants, on ABB AG bearer shares.</p>
<p>Fifty warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1700 CHF		  PREMIUM	12.20 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     3.55 CHF		  GEARING	8.80 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 04.FEB.97-21.AUG.98   PAYDATE	30.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  1686 CHF</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
